{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"This Is the Moment","artist":"Jekyll & Hyde (musical)","date":"2026-09-06","sourceId":"15069207:012","sourceHash":"331d7855336cc0809b7b430474636f305671af521baf87bc5825390cd04eef01","duration":190.04,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":23.85,"end":30.28,"text":"Every endeavor I have made ever","translation":"내가 해 온 모든 노력이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":30.97,"end":34.59,"text":"Is coming into play","translation":"결실을 맺고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":34.63,"end":38.62,"text":"Is here and now today","translation":"바로 오늘 여기에서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":39.96,"end":41.94,"text":"This is the moment","translation":"지금이 바로 그 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":42.92,"end":45.34,"text":"This is the time","translation":"지금이 바로 그때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":45.38,"end":50.43,"text":"When the momentum and the moment","translation":"기세와 순간이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":50.47,"end":52.79,"text":"Are in rhyme","translation":"완벽히 맞아떨어지는 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":52.83,"end":56.45,"text":"Give me this moment","translation":"내게 이 순간을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":56.49,"end":60.17,"text":"This precious chance","translation":"이 소중한 기회를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":60.21,"end":64.74,"text":"I'll gather up my past","translation":"지나온 날들을 모두 모아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":64.86,"end":68.84,"text":"And make some sense at last","translation":"마침내 의미를 찾겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":69.9,"end":72.48,"text":"This is the moment","translation":"지금이 바로 그 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":72.85,"end":76.08,"text":"When all I've done","translation":"내가 해 온 모든 것과","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":76.92,"end":80.88,"text":"All of the dreaming, scheming and screaming","translation":"꿈꾸고 계획하고 외쳐 온 모든 것이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":80.98,"end":83.36,"text":"Become one","translation":"하나가 되는 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":83.4,"end":86.34,"text":"This is the day","translation":"오늘이 바로 그날","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":86.38,"end":90.22,"text":"I see it sparkle and shine","translation":"눈부시게 빛나는 게 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":90.26,"end":94.24,"text":"When all I live for","translation":"내가 살아온 모든 이유가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":94.91,"end":97.89,"text":"Becomes mine","translation":"내 것이 되는 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":97.93,"end":102.24,"text":"For all these years","translation":"이 모든 세월 동안","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":102.74,"end":105.47,"text":"I've faced the world alone","translation":"홀로 세상과 맞서 왔고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":105.51,"end":109.28,"text":"And now the time has come","translation":"이제 때가 왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":109.87,"end":115.06,"text":"To prove to them I've made it on my own","translation":"내 힘으로 해냈음을 모두에게 증명할 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":115.96,"end":118.3,"text":"This is the moment","translation":"지금이 바로 그 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":119.56,"end":123.14,"text":"My final test","translation":"나의 마지막 시험","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":123.18,"end":125.28,"text":"Destiny beckoned","translation":"운명이 손짓해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":125.32,"end":130.3,"text":"I never reckoned second best","translation":"차선에 만족한 적은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":130.41,"end":132.57,"text":"I won't look down","translation":"아래를 보지 않겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":132.61,"end":135.93,"text":"I must not fall","translation":"쓰러져서는 안 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":135.97,"end":140.38,"text":"This is the moment","translation":"지금이 바로 그 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":140.53,"end":143.76,"text":"The sweetest moment","translation":"가장 감미로운 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":143.8,"end":146.84,"text":"Of them all","translation":"그 모든 순간 중에서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":146.93,"end":151.23,"text":"This is the moment","translation":"지금이 바로 그 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":151.27,"end":154.38,"text":"Damned all the odds","translation":"모든 역경을 이겨 내고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":155.08,"end":157.68,"text":"This day or never","translation":"오늘이 아니면 영원히 오지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":157.75,"end":161.98,"text":"I'll sit forever with the gods","translation":"신들과 함께 영원히 자리하리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":162.71,"end":165.09,"text":"When I look back","translation":"훗날 돌아볼 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":165.13,"end":168.8,"text":"I will always recall","translation":"나는 언제나 기억하리","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":169.57,"end":172.39,"text":"Moment for moment","translation":"순간마다","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":172.43,"end":176.16,"text":"This was the moment","translation":"이것이 바로 그 순간이었다고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":176.85,"end":179.56,"text":"The greatest moment","translation":"가장 위대한 순간","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":179.6,"end":187.04,"text":"Of them all","translation":"그 모든 순간 중에서","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}